      "created_at": "2015-02-18T19:36:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had a fundamental disagreement with my gaming group last night.&nbsp; Simplified situation:</p><p>Hero A has 10 hp</p><p>Villain B has 10 hp</p><p>Hero C has 9 hp.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Environment card says \"deal the non-environment target with the 2nd highest HP 1 damage\"</p><p>I'm convinced that Hero C is the target with the 2nd highest HP.&nbsp; My group insists that because two targets (Hero A and Villain B) are tied for highest hp, one of those two has to be the target with the 2nd highest HP.</p><p>What's the answer?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
